{"4530740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Marmorea", "steam_appid": 4530740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guido Tognocchi is an actor. You might recognize him from a commercial or a crime drama. Matter of fact, his face is more familiar to TV audiences than it is to himself. And in the small village of Pietralba, nestled in the marble rock of the Apuan Alps, fame means nothing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530740/extras/d63e56c7e421c69a546f210e03f6cdc2.poster.avif?t=1784285936\" aria-label=\"car\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530740/extras/d63e56c7e421c69a546f210e03f6cdc2.webm?t=1784285936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530740/extras/d63e56c7e421c69a546f210e03f6cdc2.mp4?t=1784285936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all began with a concerned letter from his brother. From that moment on, every feeling of certainty vanished. Guido went back to his native village in the mountains, where he could sense the presence of something  ancient and dark, something that didn't wish to be found. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530740/extras/a2234f8165af77cc6add2ddca68b13b7.poster.avif?t=1784285936\" aria-label=\"quarry2\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530740/extras/a2234f8165af77cc6add2ddca68b13b7.webm?t=1784285936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530740/extras/a2234f8165af77cc6add2ddca68b13b7.mp4?t=1784285936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guido must now cross the gloomy, misty village, decipher cryptic riddles and sift through mysterious documents, all while being immersed in the silence of the Apuan Alps. He has nothing to depend on but his senses, his wits and internal compass.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530740/extras/864d273874ef48068a52c6aeb443994e.poster.avif?t=1784285936\" aria-label=\"quarry\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530740/extras/864d273874ef48068a52c6aeb443994e.webm?t=1784285936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530740/extras/864d273874ef48068a52c6aeb443994e.mp4?t=1784285936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Marmorea</i> every shadow is suspect, every detail is a clue to stay alive and move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you unravel the secrets of Pietralba? </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guido Tognocchi is an actor. You might recognize him from a commercial or a crime drama. Matter of fact, his face is more familiar to TV audiences than it is to himself. And in the small village of Pietralba, nestled in the marble rock of the Apuan Alps, fame means nothing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530740/extras/d63e56c7e421c69a546f210e03f6cdc2.poster.avif?t=1784285936\" aria-label=\"car\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530740/extras/d63e56c7e421c69a546f210e03f6cdc2.webm?t=1784285936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530740/extras/d63e56c7e421c69a546f210e03f6cdc2.mp4?t=1784285936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all began with a concerned letter from his brother. From that moment on, every feeling of certainty vanished. Guido went back to his native village in the mountains, where he could sense the presence of something  ancient and dark, something that didn't wish to be found. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530740/extras/a2234f8165af77cc6add2ddca68b13b7.poster.avif?t=1784285936\" aria-label=\"quarry2\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530740/extras/a2234f8165af77cc6add2ddca68b13b7.webm?t=1784285936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530740/extras/a2234f8165af77cc6add2ddca68b13b7.mp4?t=1784285936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guido must now cross the gloomy, misty village, decipher cryptic riddles and sift through mysterious documents, all while being immersed in the silence of the Apuan Alps. He has nothing to depend on but his senses, his wits and internal compass.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530740/extras/864d273874ef48068a52c6aeb443994e.poster.avif?t=1784285936\" aria-label=\"quarry\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530740/extras/864d273874ef48068a52c6aeb443994e.webm?t=1784285936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530740/extras/864d273874ef48068a52c6aeb443994e.mp4?t=1784285936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Marmorea</i> every shadow is suspect, every detail is a clue to stay alive and move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you unravel the secrets of Pietralba? </p>", "short_description": "Venture into the Tuscan village of Pietralba to solve the mystery of your brother’s disappearance. Uncover the dark secrets buried within the marble quarries and your own family's past.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530740/b40074a6864c6175fe29ab55fcf6bd72fdf2856f/header.jpg?t=1784285936", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530740/f76df3c2fe30b0e520b785c322a013f5ef84a3bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784285936", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530740/f76df3c2fe30b0e520b785c322a013f5ef84a3bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784285936", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core 2 Quad Q8300 @ 2.5GHz / AMD Phenom II X4 945<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GT 630 (2GB DDR3) / Intel HD Graphics 630<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated, compatible with direct x<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Low/Medium settings</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><stron